sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant PaymentService
    participant BillerAdapter as BillerAdapter (AquaCo)
    participant Biller as AquaCo
    participant LedgerService
    participant NotificationService
    participant SMS as SMS provider

    Note over PaymentService,Biller: Biller refusal already received; 352.50 is held

    PaymentService->>PaymentService: SENT_TO_BILLER to FAILED
    Note right of PaymentService: No fee is posted; fees apply only to completed payments

    PaymentService->>LedgerService: HOLD_RELEASE
    LedgerService-->>PaymentService: Ledger entries and audit record posted
    PaymentService->>PaymentService: FAILED to REFUNDED

    PaymentService->>NotificationService: queuePaymentOutcome(payment)
    NotificationService->>SMS: Send SMS with readable reason

    alt SMS delivered
        SMS-->>NotificationService: OK
        NotificationService-->>Customer: Payment failed; money returned
    else Provider unavailable
        SMS-->>NotificationService: Error
        NotificationService->>SMS: Retry up to 3 times
        NotificationService->>NotificationService: Mark UNDELIVERED if retries fail
    end

    Note over Customer,SMS: UNKNOWN payments are not refunded directly. They must first become FAILED.
